---
import { site, navUtama } from '../../site';

const tahun = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-line py-10">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
      <div class="max-w-xs">
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-lg font-extrabold">
          <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-linear-to-br from-brand-light to-brand" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          {site.nama}
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-muted">{site.tagline}. {site.kota}.</p>
      </div>

      <nav aria-label="Navigasi footer" class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
        <a href="/" class="py-1 text-ink-muted hover:text-ink">Beranda</a>
        {
          navUtama.map((item) => (
            <a href={item.href} class="py-1 text-ink-muted hover:text-ink">
              {item.label}
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </nav>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="py-1 text-ink-muted hover:text-ink">
          {site.email}
        </a>
        <a
          href={`https://wa.me/${site.whatsapp}`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="py-1 text-ink-muted hover:text-ink"
        >
          WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 border-t border-line pt-6 text-xs text-ink-muted">
      <p>
        Semua demo di portofolio memakai nama usaha dan data fiktif. Tidak ada
        pesanan atau pembayaran yang benar-benar diproses di dalamnya.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2">&copy; {tahun} {site.nama}.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
